From 635437da2d50e97b70526e1757ac921ec52b0b8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:23:04 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Block form: full path in the preview, "Saved to" when
 editing; drop the File tab

/block-preview returns the full .conf path instead of just the file
name, and the modal labels it "Saved to" in edit mode ("Will be saved
as" for a new block). The File tab, its read-only path box and the JS
that kept it updated are removed, along with the form's data-conf-dir /
data-originally-disabled attributes and the view arguments only it used.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
---
 caddy_manager/views.py                      |  8 +--
 static/js/block-form.js                     | 63 +++------------------
 templates/block_form.html                   | 15 +----
 templates/partials/block_preview_modal.html |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 75 deletions(-)

diff --git a/caddy_manager/views.py b/caddy_manager/views.py
index 13c95e5..2ac78c3 100644
